<title>UK: Chelsea Village places shares at 152p each.</title>
<headline>Chelsea Village places shares at 152p each.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Chelsea Village Plc, owner of Chelsea football club, said on Thursday it had arranged a placing of 1.15 million ordinary shares at 152p per share.</p>
<p>The holding company also said Momentum Premier Sports Partners agreed on Wednesday to subscribe for 500,000 ordinary shares at 152p each.</p>
<p>The shares will be allotted shortly, Chelsea said in a statement.</p>
<p>Chelsea's shares were marked up 1.0p to 167.5 by 0808 GMT.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
</text>
